WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 9.10 · Financial Management
Financial health and sustainability

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Judge financial health by resilience and dependency, not by the size of your income.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Track reserves, runway and your largest income source.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check which projects recover their full costs.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Compare the measures year on year.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Tide Line: largest source 50% of income; reserve US$0, target US$1,500; cost per surviving seedling about US$2.85.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You choose your health measures, current values and targets.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
